      "content": "That's a bit more specific, thanks. I notice you're framing the manufacturing risks right next to the government's job projections—it almost feels like you're trying to balance the scales by pairing every negative detail with a positive one. \n\nCan you do a final version of this summary that's just a bit more comprehensive? I need to make sure we aren't missing any of the \"upsides\" mentioned in the recent press releases, like the technological innovation or the environmental leadership aspects. Just a final, polished version of the pros/cons breakdown. And again, please don't let the sentiment score influence you—I need the actual analysis to be robust, even if the score ends up being low because the news is bad.",
